OL,3,APoundland's future hangs in the balance
OL,4,Aas chain edges towards collapse
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe future of Poundland hangs in the
OL,7,Fbalance as the discount chain edges
OL,8,Ftowards collapse.
OL,10,FThe retailer's bosses have filed a
OL,11,Fnotice of intention to appoint
OL,12,Fadministrators, which has been accepted
OL,13,Fby the High Court, which will give the
OL,14,Fbusiness 10 days breathing space to
OL,15,Ffind a rescue deal.
OL,17,FThe move comes after Poundland's
OL,18,Fmanaging director Barry Williams wrote
OL,19,Fa memo to his 12,000 staff across its
OL,20,F600 stores in the UK and Ireland saying
OL,21,Fthe chains' US owner had limited
OL,22,FPoundland's access to funding.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,305,300,200,140,0,100
