OL,3,APoundland's future hangs in the balance
OL,4,Aas chain edges towards collapse
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt is understood the firm's owner,
OL,7,FGordon Brothers, wants to break up the
OL,8,Ffirm, with rivals Poundstretcher, B&M
OL,9,Fand Lidl interested in potentially
OL,10,Fbuying up stores.
